
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Worker as Heroku Worker
    participant Redis
    participant Browserless as Remote Browser (WS)
    participant Vendor as Vendor Site

    %% --- Job Submission Flow ---
    Note over User, API: Job Submission
    User->>Frontend: Fill Job Form & Submit
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/jobs (payload + vendor)
    API->>DB: CREATE Job (Status: PENDING)
    API->>MQ: PUBLISH Job (Encrypted, x-max-retries)
    API-->>Frontend: Return jobId
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/jobs/:id/stream (SSE)
    API->>Redis: SUBSCRIBE job.status.{jobId}

    %% --- Worker Processing Flow ---
    Note over Worker, Vendor: Async Processing
    Worker->>MQ: CONSUME Message
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note right of Worker: Failure Simulation
        Worker->>Worker: Check Random Failure Rate
        alt Simulation Triggered
            Worker--xWorker: Throw Error
            Worker->>MQ: NACK (Requeue or DLQ)
        end
    end

    Worker->>DB: UPDATE Job (Status: IN_PROGRESS)
    Worker->>Redis: PUBLISH Status (IN_PROGRESS)
    Redis-->>API: Message Received
    API-->>Frontend: SSE Event (IN_PROGRESS)

    %% --- Remote Browser Execution ---
    Note right of Worker: Offloaded to Browserless
    Worker->>Browserless: Connect via WebSocket (CDP)
    Browserless->>Browserless: Create Browser Context (Incognito)
    Browserless->>Vendor: Navigate & Fill Form
    Vendor-->>Browserless: Scrape Results
    Browserless-->>Worker: Return Scraped Data
    Worker->>Browserless: Close Context

    %% --- Completion & Quote Creation ---
    Note over Worker, DB: Completion
    Worker->>DB: INSERT Quote (Job Result Data)
    Worker->>DB: UPDATE Job (Status: COMPLETED)
    Worker->>Redis: PUBLISH Status (COMPLETED)
    Redis-->>API: Message Received
    API-->>Frontend: SSE Event (COMPLETED)
    Frontend-->>User: Show Success & Data

    %% --- DLQ Monitoring Flow ---
    Note over User, MQ: Dashboard Monitoring
    User->>Frontend: View Dashboard
    loop Every 5 Seconds
        Frontend->>API: GET /admin/stats
        API->>MQ: Check DLQ Depth
        MQ-->>API: Return Count
        API-->>Frontend: Return { dlqDepth }
        Frontend-->>User: Update Alert Status
    end
